  "customHelp": "Chronicle TCG prototype.\n\nMain Deck: 25-30 cards, maximum 2 copies per card.\nTitan Deck: 1-5 Titan cards, maximum 2 copies per card.\nResource Deck: exactly 15 Resource cards; Resources are exempt from the 2-copy limit.\n\nOpening hand: 5 Main Deck cards. No mulligan. Each player starts with 3 Points.\nThe first player skips both draws on their first turn. On later turns, draw 1 from the Main Deck and 1 from the Resource Deck.\n\nChronicle uses manual combat/effect enforcement in TCG Arena. Stage Boosts, attack legality, resource attachment, spell costs, Field Spell replacement, direct attacks, Points, hand limit, and deck-out are handled by the players.",
